{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19503","headline":"裴侍郎大尹雪中遗酒一壶兼示眼疾平一绝有闲行把酒之句斐然仰酬 · 刘禹锡","name":"裴侍郎大尹雪中遗酒一壶兼示眼疾平一绝有闲行把酒之句斐然仰酬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卷尽轻云月更明，金箆不用且闲行。\n若倾家酿招来客，何必池塘春草生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19503.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19503","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}